module scf_demo
  A self-consistent field in miniature, to show the debug and story lenses.

fock  @cb8faeb1

density  @b16b5a5e

energy  @d5e80872

diis  @eec3f70b

scf  @7900cbbc
  E      the mean-field energy
  dnorm  how much the density changed in the last iteration
  D      the density matrix, two electrons in the lowest orbital

  guess      start from the lowest orbital of the core Hamiltonian
  repeat until the density stops changing
    fock     form the Fock matrix from the current density
    solve    solve F C = C e for the orbitals
    density  fill the lowest orbital with both electrons
    mix      take half the new density and half the old
    energy   evaluate the energy of the mixed density
  check      confirm that the Fock matrix commutes with the density
